@context: The smallest useful hunt — open a page, check it, follow a link.
@title: first_hunt

# A hunt is plain English, one action per line. Commands are case-insensitive,
# and the text you mean goes in single quotes, exactly as a person sees it.
# {site} is a variable; every example declares it once, here at the top.
@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000

STEP 1: Open the home page
    NAVIGATE to {site}/index.html
    VERIFY that 'Welcome to the Manul quickstart site' is present

STEP 2: Follow a link by its text
    CLICK the 'Login page' link
    VERIFY that 'Sign in' is present

DONE.
